            "id": "960561524",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "caption": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "This graph shows the potential energy relationships for the reaction A + B "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": false,
                    "src": "\\rightarrow",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": " C + D. The curve represents the energy of the system at any point as the reaction progresses from reactants A and B to products C and D. The activation energy for the forward reaction is represented by "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "E"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "a"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": ". The activation energy for the reverse reaction is greater than that for the forward reaction by an amount equal to Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "(H)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": ". The curve’s peak represents the transition state."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "9ly587r79r7mjov",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "i2xl5whp91zfnue",
            "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/ba/bae74d0bb456b7a28b7e9f566c442766/blank_space.png",
            "type": "img",
            "width": "450"
          },
          {
